Create Or Replace View VWFAC_Ventas_Sup_Ven_Cli_Art_Ano_Meses
As Select T1.DtoAno, T4.SupCve, T5.SupNom, T3.VenCve, T4.VenNom,
          T1.CliCve, T6.CliNom, T1.ArtCve, T2.ArtDes,
IfNull (Sum(Case When T1.DtoMes = 01 Then T1.DtoCua End), 0) Ene,
IfNull (Sum(Case When T1.DtoMes = 02 Then T1.DtoCua End), 0) Feb,
IfNull (Sum(Case When T1.DtoMes = 03 Then T1.DtoCua End), 0) Mar,
IfNull (Sum(Case When T1.DtoMes = 04 Then T1.DtoCua End), 0) Abr,
IfNull (Sum(Case When T1.DtoMes = 05 Then T1.DtoCua End), 0) May,
IfNull (Sum(Case When T1.DtoMes = 06 Then T1.DtoCua End), 0) Jun,
IfNull (Sum(Case When T1.DtoMes = 07 Then T1.DtoCua End), 0) Jul,
IfNull (Sum(Case When T1.DtoMes = 08 Then T1.DtoCua End), 0) Ago,
IfNull (Sum(Case When T1.DtoMes = 09 Then T1.DtoCua End), 0) Sep,
IfNull (Sum(Case When T1.DtoMes = 10 Then T1.DtoCua End), 0) Oct,
IfNull (Sum(Case When T1.DtoMes = 11 Then T1.DtoCua End), 0) Nov,
IfNull (Sum(Case When T1.DtoMes = 12 Then T1.DtoCua End), 0) Dic,
IfNull (Sum(T1.DtoCua), 0) Total
     From FacDtod T1
     Join InvArt T2
       On (T1.ArtCve = T2.ArtCve)
     Join CxcRvc T3
       On (T1.CliCve = T3.CliCve)
     Join CxcVen T4
       On (T3.VenCve = T4.VenCve)
     Join CxcSup T5
       On (T4.SupCve = T5.SupCve)
     Join CxcCli T6
       On (T1.CliCve = T6.CliCve)
    Where (T1.DtoTip <> 3)
 Group by T1.DtoAno, T4.SupCve, T5.SupNom, T3.VenCve, T4.VenNom,
          T1.CliCve, T6.CliNom, T1.ArtCve, T2.ArtDes
